        "title": "Present perfect for experience, past simple for detail",
        "rule_summary": "Introduce an experience with the present perfect when the time is not the focus, then move to the past simple for the specific story or finished details.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "وقتی زمان دقیق مهم نیست تجربه را با present perfect معرفی می‌کنیم و برای جزئیات مشخص و تمام‌شده به past simple می‌رویم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "I've completed two professional courses. The last one took six months.",
